01:15:10.555 --> 01:15:10.861
Last few seconds


01:15:10.948 --> 01:15:13.091
We pull down the path Last few seconds


01:15:13.179 --> 01:15:14.534
We pull down the ice


01:15:14.972 --> 01:15:15.409
He shoots


01:15:15.934 --> 01:15:17.595
He scores!


01:15:18.689 --> 01:15:21.662
Wade Whipple is the champion again


01:15:21.750 --> 01:15:28.309
Oh hey Sonic


01:15:28.397 --> 01:15:29.402
You see my goal?


01:15:29.752 --> 01:15:30.758
Pretty sick, right?


01:15:31.195 --> 01:15:32.376
