01:20:04.945 --> 01:20:06.869
You're no Maria


01:20:09.930 --> 01:20:14.128
The moment I lost
her, my family was gone forever


01:20:15.965 --> 01:20:17.977
The only way to give Maria's life meaning


01:20:18.064 --> 01:20:20.600
is to destroy the
world that took her from me


01:20:20.950 --> 01:20:22.962
So I'm burning it all down!


01:20:25.936 --> 01:20:27.029
It's done


01:20:27.947 --> 01:20:29.040
Good work, Shadow


01:20:29.959 --> 01:20:31.577
I'm prepping the firing sequence


01:20:31.664 --> 01:20:35.381
The weapon will be
fully charged in ten minutes


01:20:39.973 --> 01:20:41.722
It's almost finished, Maria


01:20:42.947 --> 01:20:44.652
You will have justice


01:20:44.739 --> 01:20:50.643
What is that?


01:20:51.955 --> 01:20:53.966
Is gun launching missiles at us?


01:20:54.972 --> 01:20:55.541
Impossible


01:20:55.934 --> 01:20:57.946
It's moving too fast


01:21:01.313 --> 01:21:02.100
It's him


01:21:02.188 --> 01:21:10.190
You've hurt my family


01:21:12.945 --> 01:21:14.826
This ends now


01:21:15.963 --> 01:21:17.187
Now you know my anger


01:21:17.275 --> 01:21:20.336
The pain I've felt for 50 years


01:21:20.948 --> 01:21:23.878
And you've made the same choice I did


01:21:23.965 --> 01:21:25.452
I'm nothing like you


01:21:25.540 --> 01:21:26.764
We'll see


01:21:34.941 --> 01:21:35.947
Show yourself, coward


01:21:53.964 --> 01:22:01.967
I'm the king of all the world


01:22:02.929 --> 01:22:10.013
You were right about one thing


01:22:10.931 --> 01:22:13.730
This ends now


01:22:40.711 --> 01:22:41.717
What's happening?


01:22:42.023 --> 01:22:43.029
Where are they?


01:22:43.860 --> 01:22:45.041
Up there? Where?


01:22:45.609 --> 01:22:46.615
Higher


01:22:46.965 --> 01:22:47.140
You're dead!


01:22:47.971 --> 01:22:48.933
Left yourself open


01:22:48.976 --> 01:22:51.163
I don't know! What are you doing?


01:22:51.513 --> 01:22:52.693
Porting your evil plan!


01:23:03.932 --> 01:23:04.588
Not to possess


01:23:04.938 --> 01:23:05.681
Green!


01:23:05.944 --> 01:23:06.556
My poetry


01:23:06.949 --> 01:23:08.436
One, two, three


01:23:08.524 --> 01:23:16.526
Oh, a narrow fist


01:23:16.964 --> 01:23:20.681
I haven't seen that since I
hate watched Green Lantern in 2011


01:23:20.943 --> 01:23:22.780
I was saving it for Comic-Con


01:23:46.306 --> 01:23:48.755
But now there won't be
a Comic-Con Why are you alone?


01:23:49.717 --> 01:23:50.723
Where are your friends?


01:23:51.948 --> 01:23:54.703
They tried to stop you, didn't they?


01:23:55.184 --> 01:23:56.539
But you came anyway


01:23:56.627 --> 01:23:58.857
Your anger was too much


01:23:58.944 --> 01:24:04.148
What kind of hero
abandons his friends to pursue revenge?


01:24:04.848 --> 01:24:06.597
Abandoned his family


01:24:06.947 --> 01:24:09.396
Don't you dare talk about my family


01:24:09.483 --> 01:24:12.544
And here I thought you cared for them


01:24:12.894 --> 01:24:14.206
Especially the one...


01:24:14.993 --> 01:24:15.999
What's his name?


01:24:16.961 --> 01:24:17.224
Tom


01:24:43.943 --> 01:24:44.686
Go ahead


01:24:44.948 --> 01:24:45.779
Finish it


01:24:45.867 --> 01:24:48.884
What are you waiting for?


01:24:48.972 --> 01:24:50.021
Do it!


01:24:50.590 --> 01:24:51.901
I'm right here!


01:24:52.951 --> 01:24:56.712
You didn't let
your pain change who you are


01:24:57.718 --> 01:24:58.723
In here


01:24:58.767 --> 01:25:06.770
This is not who I am


01:25:10.137 --> 01:25:11.099
What are you doing?


01:25:11.492 --> 01:25:12.105
You won


01:25:12.192 --> 01:25:13.941
Take your revenge


01:25:15.953 --> 01:25:17.790
There are no winners with revenge


01:25:31.958 --> 01:25:32.089
Wow


01:25:32.177 --> 01:25:34.713
Look at all those stars


01:25:34.801 --> 01:25:37.512
They're like diamonds


01:25:37.556 --> 01:25:43.765
The last time I
sat beneath stars like this


01:25:45.952 --> 01:25:46.957
I was with her


01:25:48.969 --> 01:25:51.287
I felt this pain for so long


01:25:53.342 --> 01:25:54.523
It's all I know


01:25:54.960 --> 01:25:56.840
When I lost Longclaw


01:25:56.972 --> 01:25:59.202
I felt the same way


01:26:00.951 --> 01:26:03.181
Did your pain eventually go away?


01:26:04.493 --> 01:26:04.668
No


01:26:04.931 --> 01:26:09.216
But in time I learned there's
something even more powerful than pain


01:26:09.959 --> 01:26:11.971
The love we felt for each other


01:26:12.933 --> 01:26:15.426
That's what you
need to hold on to, Shadow


01:26:15.950 --> 01:26:16.956
Maria might be gone


01:26:17.962 --> 01:26:20.061
But your love will always remain


01:26:20.149 --> 01:26:28.151
The light shines
even though the star is gone


01:26:50.541 --> 01:26:51.853
This whole mess is my fault


01:26:51.940 --> 01:26:55.001
I've been so blinded by rage I thought


01:26:55.963 --> 01:26:57.450
I had no choice


01:27:00.949 --> 01:27:03.266
You always have a choice


01:27:08.951 --> 01:27:11.225
Making the right one is never easy


01:27:11.969 --> 01:27:15.642
One more thing I learned is
that when you really screw something up


01:27:16.560 --> 01:27:18.484
You can't fix it on your own


01:27:32.959 --> 01:27:34.183
Gotta go fast


01:27:34.971 --> 01:27:37.245
Don't tell me you've got a catchphrase


01:27:37.332 --> 01:27:38.819
That's right, new hedgehog


01:27:38.950 --> 01:27:40.612
And everyone loves it


01:27:40.962 --> 01:27:42.142
With hell


01:27:42.230 --> 01:27:44.679
With you, baby


01:27:44.941 --> 01:27:46.165
With you, tomorrow


01:27:46.253 --> 01:27:47.783
With hell


01:27:47.871 --> 01:27:51.544
You may never find your way


01:27:51.632 --> 01:27:59.634
I will not try to stop my
elders from destroying the world


01:28:11.135 --> 01:28:12.578
Playtime is over


01:28:21.937 --> 01:28:24.211
No going back now


01:28:27.971 --> 01:28:29.939
Set up defense


01:28:31.951 --> 01:28:33.744
Damn you, autocorrect


01:28:39.472 --> 01:28:39.647
Hey


01:28:39.735 --> 01:28:40.741
Mantis


01:28:49.968 --> 01:28:51.848
I'm right here, arachnord


01:28:51.935 --> 01:28:59.938
Mantis


01:29:03.130 --> 01:29:05.885
That's what I call mantis-scaping


01:29:05.973 --> 01:29:08.728
That's elder abuse


01:29:14.937 --> 01:29:15.681
Alert


01:29:15.943 --> 01:29:17.255
Alert


01:29:17.955 --> 01:29:18.436
Shadow


01:29:18.961 --> 01:29:19.748
Alert


01:29:19.966 --> 01:29:21.934
I see you've chosen betrayal


01:29:22.940 --> 01:29:28.188
And you were once so useful to me


01:29:28.275 --> 01:29:36.278
Ready to recycle some tin cans?


01:29:44.499 --> 01:29:45.505
Just trying to keep up


01:30:17.646 --> 01:30:18.652
Please, Grancy


01:30:19.352 --> 01:30:20.401
Don't do this


01:30:20.489 --> 01:30:21.975
Sorry, kiddo


01:30:22.063 --> 01:30:25.999
Bring your grandkid to work day is over


01:30:31.946 --> 01:30:33.957
Any last words?


01:30:35.007 --> 01:30:39.686
Just one thing
that I never thought I'd say


01:30:39.948 --> 01:30:41.479
What is it?


01:30:42.572 --> 01:30:43.884
I love you


01:30:43.972 --> 01:30:45.371
No


01:30:45.939 --> 01:30:47.689
There was something even better


01:30:47.951 --> 01:30:51.056
But I'm not gonna say it
if that's the way you're gonna be


01:30:51.143 --> 01:30:53.199
Okay, bye


01:31:04.962 --> 01:31:06.624
Grandchildren


01:31:06.930 --> 01:31:10.691
All the fun and
none of the responsibility


01:31:12.965 --> 01:31:15.676
Who said life was pointless?


01:31:16.944 --> 01:31:17.425
Huh?


01:31:17.600 --> 01:31:19.699
Oh right, you did


01:31:19.787 --> 01:31:25.952
Victory!


01:31:27.352 --> 01:31:28.882
See what you want about my granddad


01:31:28.970 --> 01:31:31.594
He made one hell of a bug zapper


01:31:33.955 --> 01:31:35.398
Gotta stop that laser


01:31:35.967 --> 01:31:37.847
I knew there was
something I was forgetting


01:31:46.943 --> 01:31:49.829
We're out of time


01:31:49.916 --> 01:31:51.753
The cannon is about to fire


01:31:51.841 --> 01:31:53.021
Where are you?


01:31:53.327 --> 01:31:55.383
Oh, you know, just making friends


01:31:55.470 --> 01:31:57.569
They're all yours


01:31:57.657 --> 01:32:05.659
Follow me


01:32:06.971 --> 01:32:07.933
Follow me


01:32:13.968 --> 01:32:16.985
Now this might hurt a little


01:32:17.073 --> 01:32:25.075
So this was your plan?


01:32:33.953 --> 01:32:38.588
Would someone mind
shutting down the giant death ray?


01:32:40.949 --> 01:32:42.874
We can't stop the cannon from firing


01:32:42.961 --> 01:32:45.060
But we can steer it away from the Earth


01:32:45.147 --> 01:32:46.678
Coming around the starboard


01:32:46.940 --> 01:32:47.596
Aye aye, Doc


01:32:47.684 --> 01:32:53.194
Here we go


01:32:54.943 --> 01:32:55.949
It's a little tight


01:32:56.955 --> 01:32:59.710
Definitely not power steering


01:33:03.951 --> 01:33:07.931
Keep turning


01:33:10.948 --> 01:33:13.091
Jump in any time here, Doc


01:33:17.945 --> 01:33:21.968
Can't hold much longer


01:33:33.950 --> 01:33:41.953
Yes! I did it! I did it!


01:33:46.894 --> 01:33:50.436
Look what you did


01:33:50.524 --> 01:33:52.360
Hey, look down there


01:33:52.973 --> 01:33:53.935
Sonnet!


01:33:56.952 --> 01:34:01.544
Oh Knuckles, please tell me you have a


01:34:02.112 --> 01:34:02.856
Last one


01:34:02.943 --> 01:34:04.736
Let's make it count


01:34:06.966 --> 01:34:09.328
Ready for a little base of ball?


01:34:10.771 --> 01:34:11.777
Deep breath


01:34:11.952 --> 01:34:12.564
One


01:34:12.957 --> 01:34:13.876
Two


01:34:13.963 --> 01:34:14.969
Three


01:34:31.936 --> 01:34:37.140
Oh! Really?


01:34:37.971 --> 01:34:38.933
What's happening?


01:34:39.195 --> 01:34:40.595
The reactor core is overloading


01:34:40.945 --> 01:34:43.656
It's only a matter
of time before it blows


01:34:43.743 --> 01:34:45.930
So what does that mean for Earth?


01:34:46.717 --> 01:34:48.116
A radioactive atmosphere?


01:34:49.209 --> 01:34:51.352
Rain that kills the
crops and melts your flesh?


01:34:51.921 --> 01:34:52.664
Other than that


01:34:52.752 --> 01:34:54.501
We're not done here


01:34:54.588 --> 01:34:56.862
You try to stabilize the reactor


01:34:56.950 --> 01:34:58.174
Buy me some time


01:34:58.262 --> 01:34:59.880
I'll push the station away from Earth


01:34:59.967 --> 01:35:01.673
Before it explodes


01:35:01.935 --> 01:35:03.640
This is our last chance


01:35:03.946 --> 01:35:06.833
To do the right thing


01:35:07.970 --> 01:35:09.719
Vaya cantillos


01:35:10.943 --> 01:35:12.649
En eso, ha bestos, ho


01:35:13.961 --> 01:35:16.278
Core integrity failing


01:35:16.366 --> 01:35:24.368
Got you, Sonic


01:35:29.966 --> 01:35:31.934
Ahh!


01:36:01.145 --> 01:36:03.769
Initializing reactor core stabilizers


01:36:03.857 --> 01:36:11.859
This is Dr. Ivo Robotnik


01:36:25.109 --> 01:36:27.689
Dedicating my final live stream


01:36:27.952 --> 01:36:30.663
To one very special henchman


01:36:31.931 --> 01:36:32.850
Agent Stone


01:36:32.937 --> 01:36:35.386
No, no, Dr. Wait


01:36:35.473 --> 01:36:37.572
If I can't rule the world


01:36:38.972 --> 01:36:40.983
I might as well save it


01:36:41.071 --> 01:36:44.438
For the one and only
person who ever cared about me


01:36:44.525 --> 01:36:46.056
Don't do this, Doctor, please


01:36:46.144 --> 01:36:50.560
Stone, you were
more than a sycophant to me


01:36:52.965 --> 01:36:53.971
You were


01:36:55.939 --> 01:36:56.945
A sickle friend


01:36:57.951 --> 01:37:01.930
I'll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk


01:37:01.974 --> 01:37:09.976
I love the way you
make them The best thing to do


01:37:53.094 --> 01:37:56.636
So, I guess there's
only one thing left to say


01:37:57.948 --> 01:38:01.840
I'm not sure


01:38:01.928 --> 01:38:03.108
It's been a real drag


01:38:03.939 --> 01:38:07.219
Rags for nothing


01:38:23.968 --> 01:38:25.192
Sonic, look


01:38:35.818 --> 01:38:37.174
Shadow and Robotnik,


01:38:37.699 --> 01:38:39.142
They sacrificed themselves


01:38:39.229 --> 01:38:41.197
To save everyone


01:38:41.941 --> 01:38:44.083
You always have a choice


01:38:45.964 --> 01:38:48.588
Guys, I'm really
sorry for running off like that


01:38:48.675 --> 01:38:50.162
I shouldn't have left you behind


01:38:51.955 --> 01:38:52.961
The truth is


01:38:53.048 --> 01:38:55.934
You're the best
teammates a hedgehog could ever ask for


01:38:58.470 --> 01:38:59.433
And the best friends


01:38:59.957 --> 01:39:02.931
Can you ever forgive me?


01:39:06.867 --> 01:39:07.872
Team Sonic?


01:39:12.464 --> 01:39:14.038
How about just team?


01:39:22.959 --> 01:39:23.965
Goodbye, Doctor


01:39:40.932 --> 01:39:42.069
Big finish


01:39:44.955 --> 01:39:47.055
Now that's what I call teamwork


01:39:47.098 --> 01:39:49.591
Okay, it's ready


01:39:52.958 --> 01:39:54.139
Knuckles, how could you?


01:39:54.795 --> 01:39:55.888
Gotta be faster than that


01:39:56.937 --> 01:39:57.943
Give me a break


01:39:58.031 --> 01:40:00.217
Still moving a little slow over here


01:40:00.305 --> 01:40:01.267
Donut more!


01:40:02.054 --> 01:40:02.185
Yay!


01:40:02.972 --> 01:40:04.284
Okay, Knuckles


01:40:04.372 --> 01:40:06.471
I am having the love


01:40:08.963 --> 01:40:10.581
Get in here, Ozzy


01:40:10.669 --> 01:40:12.724
It's great to be back together


01:40:12.943 --> 01:40:14.473
We're stronger than ever


01:40:14.517 --> 01:40:17.403
And nothing is gonna stand in our way


01:40:18.671 --> 01:40:21.951
Except that one
piece of unfinished business


01:40:30.959 --> 01:40:34.502
And way out in front of
the surprise of absolutely no one


01:40:34.589 --> 01:40:35.813
It's the Blue Blur


01:40:35.945 --> 01:40:37.694
Often imitated, never duplicated


01:40:37.781 --> 01:40:39.137
The one, the only


01:40:39.181 --> 01:40:39.705
Gah!


01:40:40.186 --> 01:40:41.455
Let's do this


01:40:41.936 --> 01:40:42.941
Yeah!


01:40:44.953 --> 01:40:45.828
Alright, boys


01:40:45.959 --> 01:40:46.965
Try and keep up


01:42:43.680 --> 01:42:46.785
Sonic the Hedgehog is
family champion once again


01:42:47.966 --> 01:42:48.534
Dales


01:42:48.971 --> 01:42:50.458
Knuckles


01:42:51.945 --> 01:42:52.951
Okay


01:42:52.994 --> 01:42:54.962
Yeah, I overshot the finish line


01:43:04.933 --> 01:43:06.901
Okay, so how do I get back?


01:43:19.189 --> 01:43:19.801
Pro tip


01:43:19.932 --> 01:43:23.343
If you're gonna take a shot at
the fastest creature in the universe


01:43:26.186 --> 01:43:27.410
You better not miss


01:43:30.952 --> 01:43:33.707
Um, I'm flattered by the cosplay


01:43:33.795 --> 01:43:35.500
But you got a few details wrong


01:43:35.587 --> 01:43:36.768
I can't blame you though


01:43:36.943 --> 01:43:38.561
It's hard to copy perfection


01:43:48.969 --> 01:43:50.062
That's a neat trick


01:44:03.356 --> 01:44:04.580
What? Who are you?

